Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:13.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.17,0:00:14.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:15.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.83,0:00:19.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He told me to kill myself if I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:22.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd rather be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anything but the punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why isn't the hero coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:30.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:38.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They said that when I was in the depths of despair,\Na hero would come to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.33,0:00:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those words have lingered in my ears ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:00:58.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get her some treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.25,0:01:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't need my payout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:23.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, that was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.13,0:01:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I came to respect you all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your backup was plenty impressive, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:31.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, no, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.21,0:01:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I barely did anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.29,0:01:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, I really wish you'd start\Nrecognizing your own talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.63,0:01:40.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should pick this up as a hobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:42.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Pick it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.63,0:01:45.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was pretty good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:47.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Considering it was my first time playing and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Worms, the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.21,0:01:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Erna, lemme pick your brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the play here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:01:59.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to fall back for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:04.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The door we came in through is blocked,\Nso we'll have to find another exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:06.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fighting in here puts us at too big a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.67,0:02:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,True that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One question, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where is the exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.08,0:02:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.83,0:02:18.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, them's the breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Barron.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oui?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.79,0:02:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's pretty obvious you coulda\Nkept workin' as a boxer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:31.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why dirty your hands with this spy killer shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:33.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oui, I see no reason to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:35.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:36.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Incoming, from the right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.21,0:02:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fuck off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.25,0:02:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not layin' one goddamn finger on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.67,0:02:45.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You actually fell for it?\NWhat a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:58.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Big Sis Sybilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:02:59.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:09.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Check out what I just nicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:12.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You wretch...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:18.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's get the hell outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:24.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Me wo aketa kikkake wa
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:24.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I would expect no less out of a spy from the Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.17,0:03:29.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Kokoro saku joukei
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:25.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The problem is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.67,0:03:28.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,you made too big of a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:32.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Hirari hirari yubi no sukima kara
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.17,0:03:33.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You gotta keep a closer eye on your valuables, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:34.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Mietekuru shinjitsu wo nirame
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:34.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:36.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, I remember you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.92,0:03:39.71,Song,,0,0,0,,Kizukareta no wa, rakuen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:40.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And on top of that, you revealed too many of your tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.71,0:03:43.63,Song,,0,0,0,,Massakasama ochite
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.00,0:03:42.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I knew you specialized in picking pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:44.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It was obvious my lighter was
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:47.42,Song,,0,0,0,,Aa tatoe kouya demo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.71,0:03:46.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,the first thing you would go for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:48.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And when you spotted the floor plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:55.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Hitori de ikiru to oritachimashou
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.17,0:03:50.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,you would have no reason not to follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:52.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The map contained the location of the stairs
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.79,0:03:54.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,leading to the fifth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If you turn at the fire extinguisher
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.67,0:03:57.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and pass through the kitchenette,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.83,0:03:59.63,Song,,0,0,0,,Koko ni aru hana wa ima eien nare to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:03:59.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,the emergency exit will be right in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.63,0:04:06.00,Song,,0,0,0,,Gokujou no chihedo wo haite watashi ga ueta mono
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:02.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But that emergency exit
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:04.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,is precisely where I laid my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:06.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:11.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Kono koe de ashi de te de watashi no mama mogaku hodo ni
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's not happenin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:09.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Exactly, I have you right where I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:17.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Doushiyou mo nai sekai ga itoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:14.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah, this ain't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.83,0:04:19.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:24.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Tadoritsuku wa kanarazu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.75,0:04:30.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Musekaeru hodo no yume
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:28.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That should be enough fire
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to fight for a good three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.38,0:04:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.67,0:04:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once the fire runs out,\Nyou'll be plunged back into darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Running is for cowards, and that shit ain't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:39.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't need this gun, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:44.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're talking about cowardice in a fight to the death?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:49.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y'know, is it just me, or is that pain I see in your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:53.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aren't we supposed to be the ones\Nwho're backed into a corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.63,0:04:55.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:57.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why're you doin' this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:04:58.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.63,0:05:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Become my Worker Ant and kill spies for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:07.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.75,0:05:10.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, and I'll save my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:12.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Family, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:13.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:15.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to save my siblings, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.79,0:05:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then why are you smiling?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Outta regret!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.83,0:05:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was drowning in despair,\Nand I thought I had no future.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.21,0:05:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.63,0:05:32.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was this guy who called me "magnificent."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.33,0:05:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nowadays, I'm a god-damned optimist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.29,0:05:39.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Keep on killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:41.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And if you lose, end your life
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:43.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,if you want your family to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:48.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then you and your optimism can die here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:58.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:07.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:16.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:18.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You and your sticky fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.79,0:06:20.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought you said guns were cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:24.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who cares about being cowardly\Nin a spy fight to the death?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was a lie I told to get you to lower your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.75,0:06:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was fibbin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:29.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why not just take the emergency exit and flee?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.63,0:06:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a set of stairs behind that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You set a trap there or somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn, you really were on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.67,0:06:43.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'd have to be, to miss something so obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I missed something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:48.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.75,0:06:52.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, man, Mouzaian's a tough language.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:54.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Learnin' to speak it was as far as I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.63,0:06:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't read a lick of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:07:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had no idea the map said "emergency exit" on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I was just runnin' around at random.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.75,0:07:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you lose, end your life...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.42,0:07:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I wasn't able to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:20.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A hero is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:23.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They'll save you when you fall\Ninto the depths of despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mustn't die before they get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:30.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There is no hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.13,0:07:33.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The hell's up with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:36.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He didn't even try to stop the bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.21,0:07:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, goddamnit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it morning already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We make a damn good tag team, you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.29,0:08:11.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel like I can do anything\Nwhen I'm with you, Big Sis Sybilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:14.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Big Sis," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:17.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All righty! Leave it all to your big sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:23.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should have that back-alley doctor\NTeach found examine you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.17,0:08:25.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's get me patched up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.42,0:08:28.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The two duos both took out their opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.25,0:08:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just as expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:36.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They lived up to all my hopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:39.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,No, that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:41.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You predicted this would happen
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:44.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and stationed the Specialist squad\Nfor maximum effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:47.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I thought Monika was the only one on Lamplight\Nwhose skills were on a different level,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:48.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,but I can see I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:51.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am worried about Lily, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should send the others in to back her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.17,0:08:55.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ex-exactly what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:00.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yo, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:03.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.42,0:09:04.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll make it brief!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:09.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me and Flower Garden ended up\Ngetting chased around town by the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:12.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But we managed to give them the slip!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:15.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's good, sounds like you two\Nmanaged to overcome your crisis, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:18.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was when twelve assassins came after us, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:20.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Twelve?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:22.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold on!\NYou're safe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:24.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where's Lily?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She drew them away from me,\Nand now she's buying time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.46,0:09:29.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll send the others over at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:31.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, see, what Flower Garden\Nwanted me to tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:35.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,was that the same thing might be\Nhappening to the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.67,0:09:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those are SOS calls from Sybilla and Monika.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:45.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If there are actually twelve assassins\Ngoing after each location...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...then just how many people are we up against?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:51.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thirty? Forty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:55.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or worst of all, could there be as many as fifty of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:57.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Two hundred and eighty-seven...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:10:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's how many Worker Ants\NI have operating in Mitario.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When they find spies, they kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And if they fail, another twelve\Ncome in to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:08.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those are their marching orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:10.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The fact of the matter is,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:14.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you and your allies simply got overrun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The CIM's Retias team got wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:23.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm told the five of them were able to\Ntake out fourteen Worker Ants,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but that was as far as they got.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Goosefoot Sisters were smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:29.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They ran for it after their seventh kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:32.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The older sister didn't make it, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shadowseed committed suicide after nine kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.42,0:10:40.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The JJJ tried to come after me too,\Nbut they quieted down right quick
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.75,0:10:43.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,when I sent the Giraffe and the Turtle\Nback to them in bodybags.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now Ouka, Ouka was something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He took out seventeen Worker Ants all on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:50.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seeing his corpse gave me quite a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had no idea he was just a teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:11:00.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It won't take me long to replace the killed Ants, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is snatch up promising civilians\Nand torture them, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:07.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just how many lives do you intend on ruining?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't talk back to your king.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.79,0:11:20.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Young Klaus doesn't seem to be coming, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.54,0:11:27.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that's fine.\NTime to kill the hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:34.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's your femoral artery I just shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You probably have about five minutes\Nbefore you bleed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you say it's about time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to tell me your name before you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:58.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They showed up out of nowhere.\NWho are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.58,0:12:07.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are there seriously twelve of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.88,0:12:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I got it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,T-tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:17.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'd be able to escape\Nif you were on your own, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:19.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me and just-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.92,0:12:22.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I did, it'd make a certain someone real sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:25.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bottom line is, ditching you isn't an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:37.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.00,0:12:47.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.92,0:12:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.38,0:12:50.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I made myself a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nobody who calls me their big sis\Nis dyin' on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.75,0:13:03.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Annette's probably gotten word to the others by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:07.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,All I gotta do is stall them a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:12.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As Lamplight's leader,\Nit's time for me to put my life on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.21,0:13:19.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lily, master of buying time.\NDon’t you dare count me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:21.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who are these people we're up against?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:32.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll disguise myself as the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.17,0:13:37.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If our opponents are working with the Empire,\Nthey should know what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.25,0:13:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If Monika and I work together,\Nwe should be able to break their line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.21,0:13:44.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But what about Lily and the Sybilla duo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:45.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We have the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold on!\NThe math doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.58,0:13:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are three different locations that need backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:51.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.96,0:13:54.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We have to do what we can with what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:13:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:01.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How can you be so brave?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:05.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have your ingenuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.13,0:14:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have the nerve to dive into\Nlife-threatening situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.71,0:14:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.50,0:14:12.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:15.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I have is a desire to repay the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a dependence bordering on obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.21,0:14:20.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to do right by the man\Nwho returned my affection,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,even after my love was unrequited.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.25,0:14:33.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, read back over the reports
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.92,0:14:36.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and think about what it is you can do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:52.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hearth, what can I even do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:56.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why did you put so much confidence\Nin someone like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:59.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll be the strongest spy around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.33,0:15:03.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you can't just be any old spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:07.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to become a hero\Nwho saves your enemies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It made me so happy when you said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.88,0:15:12.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The future seemed so rosy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.63,0:15:19.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was going to join Inferno someday\Nand work by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:23.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But the truth is I'm powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:28.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm an incompetent commander\Nand a failure of a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wish I could just disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.42,0:15:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wish I could just fade away and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:35.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:39.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to die, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:47.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had a lot of fun last month,\Nwhen you did all that stuff for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:49.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, I was surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:53.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was like, she's so meddlesome,\Nand she never actually accomplishes anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.17,0:15:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and all she's good for is picking up guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.63,0:15:59.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't mince your words, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.21,0:16:01.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But even so, I don't hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.13,0:16:04.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y'know, Flower Garden made a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She wanted me to pass you a message, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:08.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She did?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.21,0:16:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From what she found,\Nthere's been a rumor going around Mitario.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.21,0:16:17.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The story goes that when people\Nfall into the depths of despair,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,a hero will show up to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:19.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:21.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That reminds me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.33,0:16:23.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika's report said something similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.17,0:16:26.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,About how Purple Ant's minions believe in a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sybilla said the same thing,\Nthat her opponent was muttering about a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:33.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:34.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where's the rumor coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:36.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone working for Purple Ant?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.79,0:16:41.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they say the the hero is\Na beautiful girl with black hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:45.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This next bit is from Flower Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pretty convenient, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, go piggyback off the rumor\Nand become a hero for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the end of her message.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.54,0:16:56.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, I gotta get back and help her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:16:58.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.54,0:17:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With black hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What does it all mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:13.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.88,0:17:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured it was about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:27.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?\NI don't bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want me to save you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:38.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've started getting a soft spot for you lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.13,0:17:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm being serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So come on, let me out already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your little party trick isn't going to work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:55.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:56.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:58.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:17:59.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.75,0:18:03.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You made a major blunder recently, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:06.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.25,0:18:08.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I blew it, big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.50,0:18:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're talking to the guy who went after Bonfire\Nand got his ass handed to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.67,0:18:22.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I even spouted off those embarassing lines\Nabout us becoming rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:26.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want to hear my story?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.29,0:18:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I used to be a pretty boring guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:35.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My parents told me to take over the family business,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.79,0:18:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I spent my days doing what they expected of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.88,0:18:43.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But that all changed when I met this\Nweird guy called Purple Ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Purple Ant...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.88,0:18:47.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He remolded me into a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:52.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My talents surpassed those of\Nthe other Worker Ants in no time,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:54.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and he gave me all kinds of special treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I traveled around the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:59.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,murdering one politician and spy after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.33,0:19:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it turned out...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:06.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that all that awaited me was tedium.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:08.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You get it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:10.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was no goal behind my killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.75,0:19:13.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just was carrying out\NPurple Ant's orders, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:18.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I was doing was taking the people\Nthe conveyer belt sent me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:21.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and slapping an "assassinated" stamp on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.21,0:19:25.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was this big old void in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What was I even living for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.83,0:19:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But then, someone told me a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They did?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:38.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They told me that there was\Nsomeone who could fill that void,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.46,0:19:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,a monster who was stronger than anyone,\Nwho no one could kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:45.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and who could complete any mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:49.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought that the monster would be able\Nto give my life meaning,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:52.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but look at where that got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, your blunder left your heart in pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:20:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and you have no idea\Nhow to get your life back on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That ringing any bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:04.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should team up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.21,0:20:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As fellow losers, we can retake our lives together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your offer doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.88,0:20:12.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If what you said is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then you shouldn't be able to defy Purple Ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.25,0:20:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, don't lump me in with the cannon fodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.67,0:20:19.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,His control over me isn't as strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.75,0:20:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you have any proof of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:22.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't kill myself, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:26.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The other Worker Ants all try to off themselves\Nas soon as they lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.17,0:20:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:31.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time to make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:35.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you going to let me out, or leave me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.75,0:20:59.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, the part about me being special was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.13,0:21:05.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Purple Ant didn't order me to kill myself if I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.42,0:21:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He ordered me to decieve my enemies\Nand make it back no matter what it took.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not too bright, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.29,0:21:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fooling you took barely any effort at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.88,0:21:39.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He never fails to impress.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:43.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not only did he escape all on his own,\Nhe even captured a hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:45.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What frightening amounts of talent he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.21,0:21:51.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you Purple Ant?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see my reputation precedes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, how about you and I have a little chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:31.96,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Aa, kataashi de tatte tsurai okimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.79,0:22:37.79,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Mou kyouyuu shite chanto yottemasuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.25,0:22:43.63,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Ai o motte chigau nanika abiserare
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.79,0:22:49.17,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Yakkaisou de jama na watashi, waita waita
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.58,0:22:52.21,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Honto daijoubu?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.21,0:22:54.83,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Sore kiite dou suru no?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.00,0:23:00.25,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Tada homeru dake de ii
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.38,0:23:04.00,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Iienai ienai kagami no sei
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.00,0:23:07.38,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Mirenai kienai yogoreta sei
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.54,0:23:12.04,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Assari kamikitte sameta me de uso o minuku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.25,0:23:14.92,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Katenai kaenai na muku na hin
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:18.25,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Suteru mono nai mukurodashi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:23.75,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Kakugo wa kakusazu hada de te ni motte aragau
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:26.13,Song-2,,0,0,0,,(whoo, whoo, ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.13,0:23:29.13,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Rakugaki darake no aimai na unmei
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.33,0:23:31.63,Song-2,,0,0,0,,(whoo, whoo, ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.63,0:23:35.25,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Kami de sae keisotsu ni damashiteku
